ties.","zh":"Gartner, Inc.（NYSE：IT）提供可操作、客觀的業務和技術見解，推動組織在關鍵任務優先事項上做出更明智的決策並提高績效。"},{"en":"We are a trusted advisor and an objective resource for over 13,000 enterprises in approximately 90 countries and territories— across every major function, geography, industry and sector.","zh":"我們是約 90 個國家和地區超過 13,000 家企業值得信賴的顧問和客觀資源，涵蓋各個主要職能、地理位置、行業和部門。"},{"en":"Gartner delivers its products and services globally through three reportable segments – Business and Technology Insights, Conferences and Consulting, as described below. In the second quarter of 2025, we renamed our segment previously referred to as Research to Business and Technology Insights (or \"Insights\") to reflect the nature of the value we provide to clients. In the third quarter of 2025, we changed the structure of our internal organization and concluded that Gartner Digital Markets (\"Digital Markets\") was an operating segment but does not meet the criteria of a reportable segment. Accordingly, Digital Markets results are now included in \"Other\" where segment information is provided. Digital Markets was previously included in our Insights segment. Prior periods have been recast to conform to current period presentation. On February 5, 2026, we completed the sale of Digital Market","zh":"Gartner 透過三個可報告的部門在全球範圍內提供其產品和服務：業務和技術洞察、會議和諮詢，如下所述。 2025 年第二季度，我們將先前稱為「研究」的部門重新命名為「業務和技術洞察」（或「洞察」），以反映我們為客戶提供的價值的性質。 2025 年第三季度，我們改變了內部組織結構，並得出結論：Gartner 數位市場（「數位市場」）是營運部門，但不符合可報告部門的標準。因此，數位市場結果現在包含在提供分部資訊的「其他」中。數位市場之前包含在我們的洞察部分中。先前期間已重新調整，以符合當前期間的列報。 2026年2月5日，我們完成了Digital Market的出售"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our diversified business model provides multiple entry points and sources of value for our clients that lead to increased client spending on our insights, conferences and consulting services. A critical part of our long-term strategy is to increase business volume and penetration with our most valuable clients, identifying relationships with the greatest sales potential and expanding those relationships by offering strategically relevant insights. We also seek to extend the Gartner brand name to develop new client relationships, augment our sales capacity and expand into new markets around the world. These initiatives have created additional revenue streams through more effective packaging, campaigning and cross-selling of our products and services. In addition, we seek to increase our revenue and operating cash flow through more effective pricing of our products and services.","zh":"我們的多元化業務模式為客戶提供了多種切入點和價值來源，從而增加了客戶在我們的見解、會議和諮詢服務上的支出。我們長期策略的關鍵部分是增加我們最有價值客戶的業務量和滲透率，確定具有最大銷售潛力的關係，並透過提供策略相關的見解來擴大這些關係。我們也尋求擴展 Gartner 品牌名稱，以發展新的客戶關係、增強我們的銷售能力並擴展到全球新市場。這些措施透過更有效的包裝、行銷和交叉銷售我們的產品和服務創造了額外的收入來源。此外，我們尋求透過更有效的產品和服務定價來增加收入和營運現金流。"},{"en":"INSIGHTS. Gartner delivers independent, objective insights to leaders across an enterprise through subscription services that include on-demand access to published content, data and benchmarks, and direct access to a network of more than 2,400 business and technology experts located around the globe. Gartner insights are the fundamental building block for all Gartner products and services. We combine our proprietary research methodologies with extensive industry and academic relationships to create Gartner products and services that address each role across an enterprise. Within the Insights segment, Global Technology Sales (\"GTS\") sells products and services to users and providers of technology, while Global Business Sales (\"GBS\") sells products and services to all other functional leaders, such as human resources, supply chain, finance, and marketing.","zh":"見解。 Gartner 透過訂閱服務向整個企業的領導者提供獨立、客觀的見解，其中包括按需存取已發布的內容、數據和基準，以及直接存取由全球 2,400 多名業務和技術專家組成的網路。 Gartner 見解是所有 Gartner 產品和服務的基本構建塊。我們將專有的研究方法與廣泛的產業和學術關係相結合，創造可滿足企業各個角色的 Gartner 產品和服務。在洞察部門中，全球技術銷售（「GTS」）向技術使用者和提供者銷售產品和服務，而全球業務銷售（「GBS」）則向所有其他職能領導者（例如人力資源、供應鏈、財務和行銷）銷售產品和服務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Superior content - We believe that we create the broadest, highest-quality and most relevant insights coverage across all major functional roles in an enterprise. Our independent operating model and research analysis generates unbiased insights that we believe are timely, thought-provoking, comprehensive and actionable, and that is known for its high quality, independence and objectivity.","zh":"優質內容－我們相信我們能夠為企業的所有主要職能角色創造最廣泛、最高品質和最相關的見解。我們的獨立營運模式和研究分析產生公正的見解，我們認為這些見解是及時的、發人深省的、全面的和可操作的，並以其高品質、獨立性和客觀性而聞名。"},{"en":"Our global footprint and established customer base - We have a global presence with clients in approximately 90 countries and territories on six continents. A substantial portion of our revenue is derived from sales outside of the United States.","zh":"我們的全球足跡和成熟的客戶群 - 我們的客戶遍及六大洲約 90 個國家和地區。我們收入的很大一部分來自美國以外的銷售。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Insights","val":5072570000,"zh":"見解"},{"name":"Conferences","val":644743000,"zh":"會議"},{"name":"Consulting","val":552499000,"zh":"諮詢"},{"name":"Other Reportable","val":227414000,"zh":"其他可報告分部"}],"total":6497226000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Insights","val":5072570000,"zh":"見解"},{"name":"Conferences","val":644743000,"zh":"會議"},{"name":"Consulting","val":552499000,"zh":"諮詢"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":227414000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":6497226000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"United States & Canada","val":4032601000,"zh":"美國和加拿大"},{"name":"Europe Middle East Africa","val":1693732000,"zh":"歐洲 中東 非洲"},{"name":"Other International","val":770893000,"zh":"其他國際"}],"total":6497226000}},"peers":["CDW","JKHY","MTD","VRSK","FTV"]}}